      "message": "`Undefined` now gets defaulted to `VertexBufferNotUsed` according to `out/Debug/gen/third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/wgpu_structs_autogen.cpp`:\n\n```\n    VertexBufferLayout VertexBufferLayout::WithTrivialFrontendDefaults() const {\n        VertexBufferLayout copy;\n        copy.arrayStride \u003d arrayStride;\n        copy.stepMode \u003d (stepMode \u003d\u003d wgpu::VertexStepMode::Undefined)\n            ? wgpu::VertexStepMode::VertexBufferNotUsed\n            : stepMode;\n        copy.attributeCount \u003d attributeCount;\n        copy.attributes \u003d attributes;\n        return copy;\n    }\n```\n\nWithout this, the `VertexStateTest.LastAllowedVertexBuffer` test fails as you can see in latest patch:\n```\n[ RUN      ] VertexStateTest.LastAllowedVertexBuffer/Metal_Apple_M1_Pro\nError: Assertion failure at ../../third_party/dawn/src/dawn/native/RenderPipeline.cpp:995 (RenderPipelineBase): (0) \u0026\u0026 \"Unreachable code hit\"\n```",
